# Italiano (Italian) language pack for MXBMRP3 - BETA.
# Drafted for 1.35; not yet reviewed line by line by a native speaker.
# Corrections are welcome: see README.md in the parent folder.
#
# Glossary (keep these consistent):
#   rider = pilota, bike = moto, lap = giro, sector = settore,
#   split = intermedio, gap = distacco, PB = PB / record personale,
#   standings = classifica, pits = box, penalty = penalità,
#   session = sessione, practice = libere, qualify = qualifiche, race = gara,
#   settings = impostazioni, hotkeys = tasti, rumble = vibrazione,
#   notice = avviso, callout = annuncio vocale, achievement = obiettivo,
#   profile = profilo, crash = caduta, controller = controller,
#   race number = numero di gara, auto-director = regia automatica,
#   web overlay = overlay web, On/Off = On/Off, Default = Standard.
#   Kept in English as players say them: HUD, Dash, Companion, holeshot, whip,
#   scrub, oppo, endo, stoppie, backflip, frontflip, turn down, trick, FMX,
#   OBS, live, replay, spotter, widget.
